  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: UpdatedAbilityDescriptions_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4796c32e9219d742a267c25e6354633, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 78470532214784
    m_Localized: Chill enemies to the bone, making them unable to move or attack
      for a short time. A <size=110%><color=#87CEFA>frozen</size></color> foe knocked
      into a wall will be <color=#00BFFF><size=110%>SHATTERED</size></color>, receiving
      damage untold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78528635908096
    m_Localized: <size=110%><color=#4288BF>Freezing</size></color> a low health enemy
      causes them to be instantly <color=#00BFFF><size=110%>SHATTERED</size></color>,
      executing the enemy. Execute threshold increases with <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>.
      Chilling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78550739890176
    m_Localized: Leave behind a <size=110%><color=#2AFF00>corrosive quagmire</size></color>
      that saps the health of any foe foolish enough to enter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78578443268096
    m_Localized: "The <size=110%><color=#186A00>poison</color></size> persists even
      after an enemy has left the affected area, the damage dealt increasing with
      <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>. Put them out of their misery\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78606972923904
    m_Localized: Unleash an <size=110%><color=#B400FF>affliction</color></size> that
      eats away at enemy defences. Those affected receive additional <color=#7A1712>Damage</color>
      for every <size=110%><color=#B400FF>Weaken</color></size> applied. Ouch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78631467659264
    m_Localized: The sickness spreads! <size=110%><color=#62008C>Weakened</color></size>
      enemies give off a dull <size=110%><color=#62008C>Weaken effect</color></size>
      when attacked, in an area that increases with <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79172524486656
    m_Localized: "Launch three <color=#FF8500>Missiles</color> at every enemy caught
      within the spell. If the target perishes before a <color=#FF8500>Missile</color>
      can land, it seeks a new victim\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79208742301696
    m_Localized: 'Each <color=#3A322F>Missile</color> strikes an additional enemy
      other than their target and explodes on impact. <color=#3A322F>Missile</color>
      speed, range and additional targets increase with <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>.
      No one is safe! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79244217724928
    m_Localized: 'Sap enemy <size=110%><color=#E7E7E7>Speed</color></size> and make
      their movement sluggish! Each effect <size=110%><color=#E7E7E7>Slows</color></size>
      foes further. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79262727188480
    m_Localized: Blow a bubble that <size=110%><color=#E7E7E7>Slows</color></size>
      foes and projectiles caught inside. Its lifetime increases with <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79769508163584
    m_Localized: Summon <size=110%><color=#878787>Spikes</color></size> that orbit
      you and <color=#7A1712>Damage</color> those that dare come close! All current
      <size=110%><color=#878787>Spikes</color></size> become briefly <color=red>Unbreakable</color>
      whenever <size=110%><color=#878787>Spike</color></size> is rolled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79837527191552
    m_Localized: Flying <size=110%><color=#5E4242>Spikes</color></size> will stick
      to foes and prickle them until death, dealing <color=#7A1712>Damage</color>
      that increases with <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>. Upon a
      <size=110%><color=#5E4242>Spike</color></size> HEAVY ATTACK, any orbiting <size=110%><color=#5E4242>Spikes</color></size>
      will fly! These stick to foes or remain to be launched again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79286106238976
    m_Localized: Conjure a black hole that draws enemies in, then explodes! Affected
      foes are <color=#7A1712>Damaged</color> and knocked back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79314216464384
    m_Localized: Black holes absorb <color=#7A1712>Damage</color> and afflictions
      from you and your opponents,  this accumulation is unleashed when it explodes.
      Its range and damage absorbtion increase with level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79338631507968
    m_Localized: Send foes flying with incredible force! Those knocked back receive
      further damage when SLAMMED into walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79361427550208
    m_Localized: Summon a personal forcefield that persists for a short time and
      knocks back enemies it touches, increasing SLAMMED damage with level. And look
      out! Foes sent flying will collide with others and release a damaging shockwave
      when SLAMMED.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
